          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">- All models in the Warband gain Durable. This benefit is lost when any Friendly model suffers a Wound.
- When a Friendly model is removed from play, other Friendly Minimoto models gain +1 Melee Strength until the End Phase.
- Once per game, in the Starting Phase, all Friendly Minimoto Samurai gain:
&quot;When this model deals Damage as a result of a Melee Exchange, the Enemy model gains a Stun Token. Each model may gain only one Stun Token as a result of this ability.&quot; until the End Phase.

Permitted [Samurai, Blacksmiths]</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
