          <profiles>
            <profile name="Melt" id="d800-6972-bf23-8637" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">In the End Phase, unless there is a Blizzard affecting all models or the whole Battlefield, this model suffers 2 Damage, ignoring Tough and Durable.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Kamuy" id="2963-6129-04de-f7e5" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">This model does not gain Slow from Blizzard and cannot be Healed or gain Ki Tokens other than from its Kami Trait.

When this model deals Damage in a Melee Exchange, the Enemy model gains Slow until the End Phase.

When this model is Damaged by an Enemy model in a Melee Exchange, until the End Phase, all models are in Cover and gain Slow. This is a Blizzard effect.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
