          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">- Once per game, in the Starting Phase, Friendly models&apos; Melee Weapons reduce Special Attack costs by one.
- Once per game, in the End Phase choose an Enemy Insignificant model completely within a Scenario Zone, that model does not count as being in the zone when calculating Zone Control this turn.
