              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">When this model uses Bodyguard against Models causing Fear, it gains Vengeance [Enemy] until the End Phase.

This model cannot declare Melee Actions Selecting or Charge Actions Targeting Imperial models.

If this model is recruited into your Warband, you may also recruit Ronin Imperial models.

When in The Legation Theme, during Deployment, attach two Enhancement - Equipment - Omamori cards to this model at zero Rice Cost.</characteristic>
