              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">This model&apos;s Peacock&apos;s Pride applies to Soulless models, ignoring other restrictions.

Enemy model effects cannot force this model to remove, transfer or otherwise lose its Ki Tokens.

While a Soulless Enemy model is within the Sun Goddess Aura, this model loses Weak.

If this model is recruited into your Warband, you may also recruit Ronin Seishin na Goei models.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
